WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Right-click a PDF and choose Open with, then Simple Office Tools.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The PDF is added to the current workspace.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Use Open with on a supported image in the same way.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.400
Check the imported files in Arrange.
